  "uncertainty_notes": [
    "Fixture filename says '2026' but the ballot itself is dated November 5, 2024 (General Election). Used the actual ballot date and election_type='general'.",
    "This is a 'composite' sample ballot covering ALL contests that could appear in Orange County FL — actual precinct ballots would be a subset. All 8 State Rep districts (35/37/39/40/42/43/45/47), 4 US Rep districts (8/9/10/11), and 2 State Senate districts (13/25) are captured even though a single voter would only see their own district's race.",
    "AUTHORING CHOICE - Presidential ticket: combined Pres/VP into a single candidate name with ' / ' separator (e.g., 'Donald J. Trump / JD Vance'). Each ticket's party affiliation captured (REP, DEM, LPF=Libertarian, PSL, CPF, ASP, GRE). One write-in slot included as the 8th candidate. Extraction tools may produce two separate candidate entries per ticket (one for President, one for Vice President). Scoring should accept either canonical form.",
